### Catalogs
GET http://localhost:5100/api/v1/products

### Identity register
POST http://localhost:5400/api/v1/identity/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ali@example.com",
  "password": "Pass123!",
  "firstName": "Ali",
  "lastName": "Rezaei"
}

### Customers (after event processing)
GET http://localhost:5200/api/v1/customers

### Create order
POST http://localhost:5300/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "productName": "Margherita Pizza",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 12.50
    }
  ]
}
